message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "EKG-Insight CDSS: Interpretable Clinical Decision Support System for ECG-based Myocardial Infarction Screening in Low-Resource Settings"
abstract: >-
  A web-based clinical decision support system for early screening of 12-lead
  ECG image abnormalities focusing on Myocardial Infarction, combining YOLO
  classification (YOLOv8n-cls, YOLOv11n-cls, YOLOv26n-cls), HiResCAM visual
  explanation, and a rule-based / decision-tree recommendation layer, designed
  for primary and remote healthcare facilities.
